    "name": "Restful Booker Platform API Test Suite",
    "description": "Comprehensive API Test Suite for Restful Booker Platform (automationintesting.online). Covers Auth, Rooms, Booking CRUD, Negative Validations, Conflict Checks, Messages, and Branding.",
